# Normalise line endings: LF in the repository, LF in the working tree.
# (Plan / trace artefacts written by the tools are BOM + CRLF on purpose and
# are not tracked; see .gitignore.)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.geode binary
*.lvl binary
# A patch to files that carry CRLF line endings has CR bytes in its hunks; byte for byte, or git apply refuses it.
tools/geode-sdk-2209.patch -text
